{"version":1,"content":"<p>隨着英偉達創始人黃仁勳於11月12日正式卸任CEO職務，硬件圈掀起了一場關於其親筆籤名版顯卡的收藏熱潮。<strong>在海外知名硬件社區Reddit上，一張帶有黃仁勳金色籤名的GeForce RTX 5090公版顯卡成為焦點，不少玩家認為該設備已成為記錄遊戲行業歷史的關鍵文物。</strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586376.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T07:21:27.172660+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T06:56:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T07:14:40.549004+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T07:14:40.549004+00:00","content_hash":"787ebba29374579826fef004052133218570c5585a0b9d4e7604c811f2893cae","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}